97	/* Dark: the system's choice, for every page that did not pin light.
98	   A tenant whose theme sets a SURFACE colour (bg, panel, ink or accentSoft)
99	   gets data-scheme="light" on its .tenant-root (lib/theme.ts,
100	   pinsLightScheme): its colours were chosen for a light page, and half a
