583	            notice, the links to the other pages, and (on a desktop) the keys
584	            and the Read aloud toggle. One grid (chat.css): on a desktop the
585	            notice and the links stack on the left with the keys on the right;
586	            on a phone the notice takes the whole width and the links share
587	            the last row with the toggle, so the notice is never squeezed into
588	            a narrow column beside it (the 2026-10-21 phone shot: eight lines). */}
